OL,3,GNEWSAMan buys generator 'to help
OL,4,Aneighbours' after Be Ready warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is one of dozens of people making a
OL,7,Fsimilar decision, as a Knowsley
OL,8,Fequipment supplier reported a 259%
OL,9,Fincrease in average daily generator
OL,10,Fsales in the 10 days from the
OL,11,Fcampaign's launch on 22 October.
